---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = "Álvaro Fernández Ramos | Security Engineer";
const description = "Security Engineer specializing in offensive security, malware analysis, and zero-trust architecture.";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="mesh-bg"></div>
    <Header />

    <main class="container layout-wrapper">
        <section class="hero-section reveal-up">
            <span class="eyebrow">Security Engineer · Sevilla</span>
            <h1 class="hero-title">
                Álvaro <br>
                <span class="text-accent">Fernández Ramos</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero-bio">
                Construyo <strong>software seguro</strong> y rompo sistemas para entender cómo defenderlos. 
                Ingeniería Informática orientada a la investigación en <em>seguridad ofensiva</em>, análisis de malware y arquitecturas Zero-Trust.
            </p>
            
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/projects" class="btn-magnetic">
                    Ver Proyectos
                    <div class="icon-wrapper">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="16" d="M200 216h-40M56 216h40m104-56v56M56 160v56m164-88H36a16 16 0 0 1-16-16V64a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h184a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v48a16 16 0 0 1-16 16ZM20 64l108 72L236 64"/></svg>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Asymmetrical Bento Navigation -->
        <section class="bento-grid-section reveal-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
            <div class="bento-grid">
                
                <!-- Project Card (Span 2 Cols) -->
                <a href="/projects" class="bento-card bezel-outer card-projects">
                    <div class="bezel-inner">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h2>Proyectos y Análisis</h2>
                            <svg class="arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="16" d="M200 216V56H40m160 0L40 216"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <p>Explora mi trabajo en ciberseguridad, desarrollo seguro, herramientas ofensivas y auditorías técnicas.</p>
                        <div class="decorative-blur"></div>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Stack Card (Span 1 Col) -->
                <a href="/stack" class="bento-card bezel-outer card-stack">
                    <div class="bezel-inner">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h2>Stack & Certs</h2>
                            <svg class="arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="16" d="M200 216V56H40m160 0L40 216"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <p>Mi arsenal tecnológico y certificaciones.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <!-- Profile Card (Span 3 Cols) -->
                <a href="/profile" class="bento-card bezel-outer card-profile">
                    <div class="bezel-inner">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <h2>Perfil y Trayectoria</h2>
                            <svg class="arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="16" d="M200 216V56H40m160 0L40 216"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <p>Descubre más sobre mi experiencia profesional, educación y filosofía de trabajo en el campo de la ingeniería y la seguridad de la información.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />

    <style>
        .layout-wrapper {
            padding-top: clamp(8rem, 20vh, 14rem);
            padding-bottom: var(--macro-gap);
        }

        .hero-section {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin-bottom: var(--macro-gap);
        }

        .hero-title {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .text-accent {
            color: var(--accent);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--text-primary) 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero-bio {
            font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            max-width: 700px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            border-left: 2px solid var(--border-inner);
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .hero-bio strong {
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .hero-bio em {
            color: var(--accent);
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* ── Asymmetrical Bento Grid ── */
        .bento-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .bento-card {
            display: block;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .bento-card .bezel-inner {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .card-projects { grid-column: span 2; }
        .card-stack { grid-column: span 1; }
        .card-profile { grid-column: span 3; }

        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .bento-card h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .bento-card p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 90%;
        }

        .bento-card .arrow {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-spring), color 0.6s var(--ease-spring);
        }

        .bento-card:hover .arrow {
            color: var(--accent);
            transform: translate(6px, -6px);
        }

        .card-projects .decorative-blur {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -20%;
            right: -10%;
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            background: var(--accent-glow);
            filter: blur(80px);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.5;
            transition: opacity 0.6s var(--ease-spring);
        }

        .card-projects:hover .decorative-blur {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .bento-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .card-projects, .card-stack, .card-profile { grid-column: span 1; }
            .layout-wrapper { padding-top: 8rem; }
            .bento-card .bezel-inner { padding: 2rem; }
        }
    </style>
</body>
</html>